{"id":"0a4d53c3-b87b-4404-80ee-037b4ee4dd70","object":"chat.completion","created":1794558354,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\n:root{\n  --bg:#F5F2E9;--surface:#F3F0E7;--ink:#1B2620;--muted:#5C665D;\n  --olive:#4F5E43;--gold:#B4914A;--blue:#8C9FB2;--line:#A3AC9E;\n  --serif:\"Songti SC\",\"STSong\",\"SimSun\",\"Noto Serif CJK SC\",Georgia,serif;\n  --sans:\"PingFang SC\",\"Hiragino Sans GB\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;\n}\n.slide{position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);\n  font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* ---------- 背景层 ---------- */\n.bg-field{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:\n  radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%,rgba(180,145,74,.09),transparent 70%),\n  radial-gradient(880px 760px at 47% 46%,rgba(140,159,178,.10),transparent 70%),\n  radial-gradient(950px 760px at 95% 95%,rgba(79,94,67,.10),transparent 72%),\n  linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%)}\n.bg-field:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,38,32,.045) 0 1px,transparent 1px 160px);opacity:.9}\n.dot-field{position:absolute;z-index:1;opacity:.34;\n  background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px,transparent 1.15px);\n  background-size:15px 15px}\n.dot-top{left:1096px;top:0;width:520px;height:132px}\n.dot-bottom{left:700px;top:840px;width:900px;height:240px;opacity:.20}\n.gridline{position:absolute;z-index:2;background:rgba(27,38,32,.06)}\n.gl1{left:480px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n.gl2{left:960px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n.gl3{left:1440px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n.edge-prism{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:1858px;top:150px;width:420px;height:1000px;\n  transform:rotate(15deg);transform-origin:top left;opacity:.9;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(140,159,178,.20),rgba(140,159,178,.06) 72%,rgba(140,159,178,0))}\n\n/* ---------- 规线 / 标注 ---------- */\n.top-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:48px;width:1728px;height:1px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.34)}\n.left-rule{position:absolute;left:60px;top:40px;width:1px;height:1000px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.26)}\n.rail-tick{position:absolute;left:54px;width:13px;height:1px;z-index:7;background:rgba(27,38,32,.42)}\n.rail-tick.t1{top:296px}.rail-tick.t2{top:566px}.rail-tick.t3{top:104px}\n.rail-label{position:absolute;left:44px;top:700px;width:330px;height:24px;z-index:15;\n  transform:rotate(-90deg);transform-origin:left top;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;\n  letter-spacing:5px;color:#637067;white-space:nowrap}\n.register{position:absolute;right:-7px;top:-60px;width:260px;height:260px;z-index:4;\n  border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.34)}\n.register .r2{position:absolute;inset:10px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.18)}\n.register .r3{position:absolute;inset:25px;border-radius:50%;\n  background:conic-gradient(from 210deg,rgba(79,94,67,.20),rgba(79,94,67,0) 24%,rgba(140,159,178,.30) 50%,rgba(140,159,178,.08) 78%,rgba(79,94,67,.20))}\n.register .r4{position:absolute;inset:34px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(245,242,233,.88);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08)}\n.register .dot{position:absolute;left:48px;top:165px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;\n  background:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(180,145,74,.13)}\n\n/* ---------- 头部 ---------- */\n.kicker{position:absolute;left:96px;top:82px;z-index:12;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;\n  letter-spacing:5px;color:#5C665D}\n.kicker em{font-style:normal;color:var(--olive)}\n.title{position:absolute;left:96px;top:114px;z-index:12;margin:0;\n  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:92px;line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:1px;color:#1B2620}\n.title .sep{color:var(--gold)}\n.title-mark{position:absolute;left:98px;top:266px;width:150px;height:4px;z-index:12;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),rgba(180,145,74,0))}\n.head-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:270px;width:1728px;height:1px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.26)}\n.lead{position:absolute;left:96px;top:292px;width:1220px;z-index:12;\n  font-size:21px;line-height:1.7;color:#545F56}\n.lead b{font-weight:600;color:#2C3A31}\n\n/* ---------- 卡片 ---------- */\n.card{position:absolute;top:372px;width:552px;height:470px;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.46);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);\n  padding:34px 38px 32px;z-index:10}\n.card .bar{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:4px}\n.card .idx{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;color:#7A847B;line-height:1}\n.card .name{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:46px;line-height:1;margin-top:16px;letter-spacing:2px}\n.card .chip{position:absolute;right:34px;top:34px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;\n  padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid;line-height:1}\n.card .hr{height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.18);margin:26px 0 24px}\n\n.c1{left:96px}\n.c1 .bar{background:var(--olive)}\n.c1 .name{color:#2F3D2C}\n.c1 .chip{border-color:rgba(79,94,67,.55);color:#3F4E37;background:rgba(79,94,67,.09)}\n.item{position:relative;padding-left:22px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.55;color:#26332B;margin-bottom:15px}\n.item:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:9px;width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--olive)}\n.item span{color:#5C665D}\n.stats{position:absolute;left:38px;right:38px;bottom:32px;display:flex;\n  border-top:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.14);padding-top:16px}\n.stats .st{flex:1;padding-right:8px}\n.stats .num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:1.1;color:#2F3D2C;letter-spacing:.5px}\n.stats .lab{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#77817A;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.4}\n\n.c2{left:684px}\n.c2 .bar{background:var(--gold)}\n.c2 .name{color:#6E5622}\n.c2 .chip{border-color:rgba(180,145,74,.6);color:#7A5F27;background:rgba(180,145,74,.10)}\n.stmt{font-size:23px;line-height:1.75;color:#2C3A31;margin:0}\n.stmt .hl{color:#7A5F27;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(180,145,74,.45);padding-bottom:2px}\n.emptynote{position:absolute;left:38px;right:38px;bottom:32px;\n  border:1px dashed rgba(180,145,74,.6);background:rgba(180,145,74,.06);\n  padding:18px 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#7A6B45;letter-spacing:.6px}\n.emptynote b{display:block;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2.4px;color:#8A7538;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}\n\n.c3{left:1272px}\n.c3 .bar{background:var(--blue)}\n.c3 .name{color:#3F5265}\n.c3 .chip{border-color:rgba(140,159,178,.7);color:#4B5E70;background:rgba(140,159,178,.12)}\n.grid4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px 18px}\n.cell{background:rgba(140,159,178,.10);border:1px solid rgba(140,159,178,.48);padding:15px 16px 14px}\n.cell .k{font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;color:#2C3A31}\n.cell .v{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#5D7080;margin-top:10px}\n.cell .v:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;margin-right:8px;\n  background:rgba(140,159,178,.9);vertical-align:1px}\n.footnote{position:absolute;left:38px;right:38px;bottom:32px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;\n  color:#77817A;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.14);padding-top:14px}\n\n/* ---------- 处理原则 ---------- */\n.principle{position:absolute;left:96px;top:878px;width:1728px;height:92px;z-index:10;\n  background:rgba(79,94,67,.075);border:1px solid rgba(79,94,67,.22);\n  display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 40px}\n.principle .pl{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:4px;height:100%;background:var(--olive)}\n.principle .tag{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;color:#3F4E37;\n  padding-right:26px;margin-right:26px;border-right:1px solid rgba(79,94,67,.35);white-space:nowrap}\n.principle .txt{font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#26332B}\n.principle .txt b{font-weight:600;color:#2F3D2C}\n.principle .txt .q{color:#7A5F27}\n\n/* ---------- 页码 ---------- */\n.page-no{position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:52px;z-index:15;\n  font-size:22px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#4F5B53;font-weight:600}\n.page-no .slash{color:rgba(27,38,32,.35);margin:0 4px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg-field\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-top\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-bottom\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"edge-prism\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"register\">\n    <div class=\"r2\"></div><div class=\"r3\"></div><div class=\"r4\"></div><div class=\"dot\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">LONG-DOCUMENT COVERAGE CHECK · 状态区分</div>\n\n  <div class=\"kicker\">长资料覆盖核验 <em>／</em> 06 状态区分</div>\n  <h1 class=\"title\">计划、未确定与已完成<span class=\"sep\">：</span>状态区分</h1>\n  <div class=\"title-mark\"></div>\n  <div class=\"head-rule\"></div>\n\n  <p class=\"lead\">同一份资料内，三类状态的记录程度并不相同：<b>已完成项有明确条目与数值</b>，计划项与未确定项在资料中没有对应记载，本页按原样区分呈现，不做补写。</p>\n\n  <!-- 01 已完成 -->\n  <section class=\"card c1\">\n    <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n    <div class=\"idx\">01</div>\n    <div class=\"name\">已完成</div>\n    <div class=\"chip\">资料明示</div>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <div class=\"item\">前 / 中 / 末三段核验指标已采集，可对应到具体环节</div>\n    <div class=\"item\">已确认模板 <span>17 套</span></div>\n    <div class=\"item\">复盘会议 <span>7 次</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <div class=\"st\"><div class=\"num\">9 / 284</div><div class=\"lab\">试点部门 / 原始样本</div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><div class=\"num\">13 / 7</div><div class=\"lab\">流程节点 / 复盘会议</div></div>\n      <div class=\"st\"><div class=\"num\">42.7% / 17</div><div class=\"lab\">复用率 / 模板套数</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 02 计划 -->\n  <section class=\"card c2\">\n    <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n    <div class=\"idx\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"name\">计划</div>\n    <div class=\"chip\">资料未载</div>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <p class=\"stmt\">后续推广与扩展安排，<span class=\"hl\">未在资料中说明</span>。</p>\n    <div class=\"emptynote\">\n      <b>对照项</b>\n      推广节奏 · 扩展范围 · 后续时间安排<br/>\n      资料均无对应条目，留空不推测。\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 03 未确定 -->\n  <section class=\"card c3\">\n    <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n    <div class=\"idx\">03</div>\n    <div class=\"name\">未确定</div>\n    <div class=\"chip\">资料未载</div>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <div class=\"grid4\">\n      <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"k\">日期</div><div class=\"v\">资料未载</div></div>\n      <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"k\">预算</div><div class=\"v\">资料未载</div></div>\n      <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"k\">责任人</div><div class=\"v\">资料未载</div></div>\n      <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"k\">业务成果指标</div><div class=\"v\">资料未载</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footnote\">以上四项在资料中均无对应数据，本演示不填入估计值。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 处理原则 -->\n  <div class=\"principle\">\n    <div class=\"pl\"></div>\n    <div class=\"tag\">处理原则</div>\n    <div class=\"txt\">缺失项统一标注<span class=\"q\">“资料未载”</span>，<b>不以推测填充</b>；日期、预算与业务成果数据不另行补充。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-no\">6<span class=\"slash\">/</span>6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"Let me create a single HTML page with the given style: cream background, olive accent, gold secondary, blue tertiary, serif display title, gridlines, register circle, etc.\n\nPage 6: title \"计划、未确定与已完成：状态区分\" — three status columns: 已完成 (已完成（资料明示）), 计划（资料未载）, 未确定（资料未载）, plus 处理原则 footer.\n\nLayout: 1920x1080, left margin 96px, top rule at 48px, title around y=140-260, three cards in a row, bottom principle bar, page number bottom-right \"6 / 6\".\n\nFont: use system serif for Chinese titles — no external fonts allowed. Use \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", Georgia serif for display; and sans for body.\n\nLet's write carefully with absolute positioning.\n\nStructure:\n- .bg-field, dot fields, gridlines, right register circle, edge prism optional.\n- top rule, left rule, rail ticks, rail label vertical \"LONG-DOCUMENT COVERAGE CHECK\" — hmm, should keep Chinese. Could use \"长资料覆盖核验\" vertical rail label. Good.\n- top-left meta \"长资料覆盖核验 · 状态区分\" and page number left \"06\". Actually reference has page-no at left top 28. But requirement: right-bottom \"6 / 6\". I'll put \"6 / 6\" at right bottom.\n- Title: \"计划、未确定与已完成：状态区分\" — big serif. Maybe subtitle line: \"状态三分：资料明示 / 资料未载，逐项对应\" — must be fact-consistent; it's a description, fine but keep minimal. Use a small kicker \"06 · 状态区分\" maybe.\n\nThree cards:\n1. 已完成 — 标记 \"资料明示\" — items: 前/中/末三段指标；17 套模板确认；复盘会议 7 次。 Also could add metrics small: 9 部门 / 284 份 / 13 节点 / 7 次会议 / 42.7% / 17 套. Careful: keep to bullets given. Bullet says \"前/中/末三段指标、17 套模板确认、复盘会议 7 次\". I can list sub-items with the numbers as they are given elsewhere in outline (they're from source). Safer: list \"前部指标：试点部门 9 个 · 原始样本 284 份\" etc. — these are in the outline facts, so allowed. But \"内容不得照抄参考页\" refers to reference page text, not our outline. I'll include modest sub-detail.\n\nActually to be careful, keep card 1 with three lines:\n- 前 / 中 / 末三段核验指标已采集\n- 模板确认 17 套\n- 复盘会议 7 次\n\n2. 计划 — \"资料未载\" — 后续推广与扩展安排未在资料中说明。\n3. 未确定 — \"资料未载\" — 日期、预算、责任人与业务成果指标。\n\nBottom bar: 处理原则：缺失项标注\"资料未载\"，不以推测填充。\n\nAdd status chips: 已完成 with filled olive dot; 计划 with gold open; 未确定 with blue-grey dashed.\n\nBottom-right \"6 / 6\".\n\nLet me write CSS with detail.\n\nDimensions: content area left 96, width 1728 (96→1824). Three cards each ~552 with 36 gaps: 552*3=1656 + 2*36=72 = 1728. Good.\n\nCard top y ~ 400, height ~ 460.\n\nTitle block: kicker at y=112, title at y=150 (font 88px, line-height). Let's compute: title font-size 92px, two lines? \"计划、未确定与已完成：状态区分\" is 15 chars, at 92px